There one advantage which is actually two.

Gold in the shop doesn't cost anything. You can drop and pickup gold in 
shops and you wont be credited or debited.

This means that gold created inside shop while level is created is 
gratis. The object creation routine does not know if it's creating 
objects inside or outside a shop and is thus not easily changed so that 
it would create any gold in shops.

This also means that any gold dropped by dead monsters is free to take. 
So you don't need no longer to chase those leprechauns out of shop 
before snuffing them.

